int where he not  only was able to survive off of it  that's your first challenge making  enough money to pay your bills and feed  yourself but to grow a huge Empire from  one business  and then focused on going after other  companies so we're both right you can be  like Richard Branson you can diversify  you can have investments in tons of  different companies but start with one  thing and focus on it and make it  awesome before you open up your  bandwidth because if you do it too soon  you're not going to have success and too  many entrepreneurs try it's so tempting  it's so tempting to jump on something  new because it's exciting and you feel  they can contribute and at the beginning  stages of the company there's so much  passion and energy into it and you'll  find that you just keep doing that you  get to a certain point then you flatline  do you jump to something else you start  over flatline start over flat line and  you never build anything of value so  start off by focusing on one thing make  it amazing make it awesome pour yourself  into it and then focus on doing other  things that you want to do believe for  those are watching please give this  video a thumbs up if you liked it I love  seeing those come in and I want to hear  from you if you have a comment about  this video or question for your own  company leave it in the comment section  below I always read those and I'll make  a video response for you take you guys  I'll see you soon
 

